ind":"announcement","title":"Last One Employed joins Steam Next Fest. You're hired.","summary":"HR would like a word. Last One Employed joins Steam Next Fest on October 19–26, 2026. The free demo is available now. Bring 3–10 players to a card game of office sabotage. Pass the blame, survive your inbox, and try to stay on the payroll. Fired already? You still get to vote against the coworkers who survived. Run the game on one computer with a shared screen. Everyone joins from their phone: scan the QR code and play in the browser. No mobile app needed. Play the demo with friends, then add La","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:42:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691887","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4958130-1840310314349768","game_id":"steam-4958130","kind":"announcement","title":"Office Store Restocked: New Items and Fixes","summary":"THE OFFICE STORE HAS BEEN RESTOCKED The office store has a larger perk pool — and HR probably should not have approved half of it. Every match now brings a different combination of six items, giving you more ways to survive the shift or quietly ruin someone else's. Six new consumables Corporate meal voucher — remove 2 Stress from yourself. Paid day off — gain 3 Patience. Counselling session — remove 1 Stress and gain 1 Patience. Vending-machine energy drink — gain 2 Patience, but also 1 Stress. ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-09T19:12:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314349768","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4958130-1840310314349166","game_id":"steam-4958130","kind":"update","title":"Major Visual Update: Welcome to the New Office","summary":"A MAJOR VISUAL UPDATE We have rebuilt the shared screen of Last One Employed. The rules and office politics remain familiar, but the match now does a much better job of showing what just happened, whose turn it is, and who has attracted too much attention from their former coworkers. The game table is now the center of the match The inbox deck, latest played card, discard pile, and shop now live together on one physical office table. A played card remains in the center until the next event, so t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-09T12:11:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314349166","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4958130-1840310314347228","game_id":"steam-4958130","kind":"announcement","title":"The Free Demo Is Available Now!","summary":"THE FREE DEMO IS AVAILABLE NOW! The free demo for Last One Employed is available now. Host the game on one PC, let friends join with their phones, and fight through office politics, risky cards, and a corporate party where only one employee can remain. What the demo includes Your group can start one complete 25-minute party with the demo edition's roles and cards. Play + Wishlist Download the demo now, then wishlist the full game so you are ready for release.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-08T10:59:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314347228","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4958130-1840310314347160","game_id":"steam-4958130","kind":"announcement","title":"Last One Employed — Demo Gameplay","summary":"Watch live demo gameplay of Last One Employed. Scan the QR code to join the party from your phone.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-08T10:00:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314347160","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4958130-1839041357037857","game_id":"steam-4958130","kind":"announcement","title":"Bots joined the team — corporate chat is live!","summary":"Bots joined the team — corporate chat is live! Not enough coworkers for a full table? Add or remove bots in the lobby and start with a single human player—or let a fully automated match run without any phones connected. Coworkers who know the rules The Employee bot profile can play a complete match through all four phases. Bots choose legal cards and targets, protect themselves from dangerous hits, pressure the leader, build combos, use responses and redirects, buy office perks, and vote after b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-28T09:51:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357037857","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4958130-1839041357030228","game_id":"steam-4958130","kind":"announcement","title":"Core gameplay is ready — the corporate party begins!","summary":"Core gameplay is ready — the corporate party begins! We've reached a major milestone: the core gameplay loop of Last One Employed now works from start to finish. You can create a lobby, connect 3–10 players, assign roles, play a complete match, fire employees, and crown the last one employed. One screen. Everyone's phones. Run the game on a Windows, macOS, or Linux computer and put it on a shared screen. Other players join from their phones through a browser using the QR code. No mobile app or e","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-24T17:07: